^{:go/end 1294} (go/method fixUpLongBranch "Modify the Prog list if the Prog is a branch with a large offset that cannot be\nencoded in the instruction. Return true if a modification was made, false if not.\n" ^bool [^{:tag (* ctxt7)} c ^{:tag (* obj/Prog)} p]
