^{:go/end 3499} (go/method chipfloat7 "chipfloat7() checks if the immediate constants available in  FMOVS/FMOVD instructions.\nFor details of the range of constants available, see\nhttp://infocenter.arm.com/help/topic/com.arm.doc.dui0473m/dom1359731199385.html.\n" ^int [^{:tag (* ctxt7)} c ^float64 e]
